<title>USA: Parker Drilling sets $300 mln in 144A notes.</title>
<headline>Parker Drilling sets $300 mln in 144A notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Parker Drilling Co was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Jeffries &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER PARKER DRILLING &amp; CO INC</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON  9.75	MATURITY 11/15/06</p>
<p>TYPE 144A SR NOTES ISS PRICE 99.215  FIRST PAY DATE LAST MOODY'S B1    YIELD  9.875	PAY FREQ SEMI</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-PLUS    SPREAD 360 BPS    CALLABLE FIVE YEARS</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1675</p>
</text>
